<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: synthesis -->
  <OE_Synthesis.label>合成</OE_Synthesis.label>
  <!-- EN: An insect-like caste of dryad which specializes in syntherius production. Together with its crystal growing from the body, this dryad can generate a syntherius on an ongoing basis. However, it is slow and ineffective at work or combat. -->
  <OE_Synthesis.description>一种类似昆虫的树精阶层，专门从事合成金属生产。连同从身体长出的水晶，这种树精可以持续生成合成金属。然而，它在工作或战斗中缓慢且效率低下。</OE_Synthesis.description>
  
</LanguageData>